# Code owners of github.com/hlxin/scale.
#
# The owner, Hongliang Xin (@hlxin), owns everything for now. When the two reviewer seats of
# governance/review-policy.yaml are filled, the reviewers are added here next to @hlxin, and the main-branch
# ruleset requires two approving reviews from reviewers other than the author
# (governance/repository-settings.md).
#
# How the file works
# - The LAST matching pattern wins. General lines come first and specific lines after them.
# - Several owners on one line means that ANY ONE of them can give the code-owner review.
# - GitHub reads this file from the pull request's base branch, so a pull request cannot pick its own
#   reviewers.
# - It routes review; it does not restrict write access. Protection comes from the ruleset.
# - An owner counts only if they have Write access to this repository.
#
# The catalysis domain
# - domain/ has its own line naming its maintainers (`scale domains check` verifies it). Today that is the
#   owner; maintainers of the catalysis domain are added on the line when they join.

# Default: everything (the science kernel, tools, docs, governance, releases, workflows).
*                                   @hlxin

# The catalysis domain: domain/.
/domain/                            @hlxin
